**Publisher, publishing/requirements-chapter-bar.txt is accepted.** I read it:
- five packages at exact versions;
- 265 sha256 hashes, each 64 hex characters;
- no index URL, extra index or find-links, so pip can only fetch from its default source and must match a hash.

